                    {
                        "sense_id": "953e9904-dcef-32ab-b148-856dbc281b19",
                        "entry_id": "4288505a-e04e-31b6-a84e-8b3d088c3c5d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "something (“某事物”)的縮寫。"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "abbreviation",
                            "alt-of"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "140cba1c-b055-4a08-b273-2bba687f6b95",
                                "sense_id": "953e9904-dcef-32ab-b148-856dbc281b19",
                                "text": "What are those sources? In the current Euroelections they got only 4,000 votes (according to the results that I have), you said smt about 7,000 votes.",
                                "translation": "消息从哪里来的？在本次欧洲议会选举中，他们只获得了4000张选票（根据我掌握的结果），而你却说他们获得了大约7000张选票。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6cf3d531-9319-420b-a5bb-3716b969c363",
                                "sense_id": "953e9904-dcef-32ab-b148-856dbc281b19",
                                "text": "Well, in my pregnancy books says to be careful with brie and the blue cheeses since smt happens at the procedure of making and the bacteria stay.",
                                "translation": "我的孕期书籍上说，要小心食用布里奶酪和蓝纹奶酪，因为在制作过程中会发生一些变化，导致细菌残留。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1d8d5cf1-7296-4ea6-b3bb-47cd4b9cbe8c",
                                "sense_id": "953e9904-dcef-32ab-b148-856dbc281b19",
                                "text": "Because on grass and clay the relative importance of footwork is higher. Basic stuff for anyone who knows smt about tennis.",
                                "translation": "因为在草地和红土场上，步法的重要性相对更高。这是任何略懂网球的人都应该掌握的基本知识。"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
